{"id": "34528", "title": "花花公子之痴情一章", "author": "陈美琳", "category": "文学名著", "count": 33, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34528.htm", "intro": "真不知他是哪条神经错乱了？冒着脑袋会被人用枪轰掉的危险，他居然还动了她！冤枉啊！是她说想体验一下成人的爱情滋味的而他不过是让她如愿以偿，给她上了一课而已谁知道这么一来，他却是怎么也挥不去她那娇俏的倩影瞧她那副平板得根本激不起男人欲望的乾瘪身材竟也能让他忘了他那些波大、柳腰丰臀的红粉知己们!天杀的！他一定是受了老鹰和阿风这俩个傢伙影响每天看他们夫妻鹣鲽情深的，他禁不住都想成家了！成家？这主意其实是不怎么坏啦只是对象……好像太出乎他意料之外了……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34528", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2190480.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2190481.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2190482.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2190483.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2190484.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2190485.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2190486.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2190487.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2190488.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2190489.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2190490.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2190491.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2190492.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2190493.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2190494.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2190495.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2190496.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2190497.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2190498.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2190499.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2190500.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2190501.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2190502.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2190503.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "21905